** Kadane's Algorithm

Find Min / max subarray     O(n^2)   optimize to    O(n)

int n;cin>>n;
ll ans=LLONG_MIN, sum=0;
for(int i=0;i<n;i++)
{
  11 x;cin>>x;
  sum+=x;
  ans=max(ans, sum) ;
  sum=max(sum,0LL);
}
cout << ans;

